request.description:
Expect: { "ok": true, "db": true, "email": "disabled" }

- db:false  -> MySQL not connected. Check DB_USER/DB_PASSWORD/DB_NAME in .env (quote the password if it contains '#').
- email:disabled -> BREVO_API_KEY is blank. Expected until the client sends the key; saves still work.

Expect 201: { ok, id, emailStatus, message }

Required: firstName, lastName, email, mobile, institution, presentationType, track, title.
Omit any of them to see a 400 with the validation errors.
